  <description>
    <p>BMeasureLog listens to a Bluetooth laser distance meter, keeps a history of readings and lets you copy them with one click or shortcut.</p>
    <p>Currently tested with the Bosch AdvancedDistance 50C. This is an unofficial app, not affiliated with or endorsed by Robert Bosch GmbH.</p>
  </description>
